# Skyline needs NO configuration: every core feature runs on keyless APIs
# (Open-Meteo, BigDataCloud, RainViewer, OpenStreetMap).
#
# Optional: an OpenWeather key enables extra map layers and One Call 3.0
# severe-weather alerts. Vite inlines VITE_* variables into the client bundle
# at build time, so this key is PUBLIC to every visitor. Only set it with a
# domain-restricted key. https://openweathermap.org/api
VITE_OPENWEATHER_KEY=
